msgctxt "103\t181"
msgid "These're our stompin' grounds, asshole!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "210\t296"
msgid "Now step aside and hand us the girl!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340\t438"
msgid "We don't got time for your bullshit heroics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476\t539"
msgid "The hell are you, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540\t587"
msgid "Aniki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588\t721"
msgid ""
"Sorry. I heard yelling,\\n"
"so I had to come check it out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "722\t858"
msgid ""
"Should've gone the other way, pal.\\n"
"Now turn around before we make you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "887\t998"
msgid ""
"This is the girl?\\n"
"The one they were trying to take?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "999\t1112"
msgid "Yup. They wouldn't stop, even after she refused."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1147\t1214"
msgid "Is that so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1225\t1347"
msgid ""
"Who. Gives. A shit?\\n"
"Nothin' you can do about it, anyway."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1348\t1426"
msgid "We're un-freakin'-stoppable!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1482\t1539"
msgid "What's that supposed to mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1558\t1699"
msgid "It means, fix your eyes on this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1705\t1760"
msgid "\"Nishiki\""
msgstr ""